SUMMARY: Bay Club Summer Camps - Open to Everyone!
DESCRIPTION:Bay Club Summer Camps give families access to world-class spo
 rts\, fitness\, and enrichment programming\, no membership required. Open
  to both members and non-members\, camps feature age-appropriate athletic
 s including aquatics\, basketball\, and tennis\, along with engaging acti
 vities like arts & crafts\, DIY projects\, STEM challenges\, group games\
 , theme weeks\, and team-building exercises.\n\nFlexible scheduling makes
  it easy to fit camp into your summer: choose from full-day\, half-day\, 
 single-day\, or weeklong sessions. Select programs include lunch.\n\nEarl
 y enrollment is now open at most clubs with early-bird discounts availabl
 e.\nMembers always save 25% on all registrations.\n\nBay Club operates 35
 + locations along the West Coast\, from Seattle to San Diego. Visit baycl
 ubs.com/camps http://bayclubs.com/camps for pricing by activity and club 
 location.
