SUMMARY: W.O.M.E.N. in Leadership Conference Tour - Portland
DESCRIPTION:Leading Without Losing Yourself: A Mental Wellness & Self-Car
 e Conference for Women in Leadership\n\nJoin professional women from acro
 ss the Portland area for an afternoon of conversation\, connection\, and 
 practical insight around leadership resilience and wellbeing.\n\nThis gat
 hering is designed for women navigating the pressures of leadership\, car
 eer growth\, and responsibility while maintaining their mental wellness a
 nd sense of purpose.\n\nThe event includes speakers\, networking\, and th
 oughtful discussion focused on sustainable leadership and community suppo
 rt.\n\nDoors open at 10:30 AM for breakfast and networking.\nProgram runs
  11:00 AM – 4:00 PM.
CATEGORIES:women's-conference,women's-event,leadership-conference,women-l
