SUMMARY: Earth Month Plant Exchange at Argyle Winery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Month with Argyle Winery at Argyle’s Spirit H
 ouse with an afternoon dedicated to plants\, community\, and the vineyard
 . From 12–3 PM\, bring a plant\, cutting\, or clipping to exchange with f
 ellow plant lovers and discover something new to take home.\n\nThe Vineya
 rd Manager\, Erica Miller\, will be on site to share insights about viney
 ard farming and sustainability\, and Al’s Garden Center will be joining u
 s with expert plant advice and guidance for gardeners of all experience l
 evels.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed afternoon connecting with the Argyle community 
 while exploring the exchange.\n\nWine will be available by the glass for 
 purchase during the event\, featuring a selection of Argyle’s springtime 
 favorite wines. Plants\, fresh air\, and a glass of Argyle – spring at it
 s best.\n\nAfter  you’ve made your selection\, we invite you to reserve a
  seated tasting to round out your visit. 
CATEGORIES:Argyle-Winery,Argyle,Earth-Month,Plant-Exchange
