SUMMARY: Wine on Water
DESCRIPTION:Taste your way through Oregon on this sunset wine tasting cru
 ise aboard the Portland Spirit! More than a dozen local wineries will be 
 on board to showcase their latest vintages. Tickets include a two-hour su
 nset cruise\, 14 wine tasting tickets and a souvenir wine tasting glass.\
 n\nApril 16th\nFeatured Wineries:\n\n  * Abundancia Vineyards https://www
 .abundanciavineyardsllc.com/\n  * Archetype12 Wines https://archetype12.c
 om/\n  * Balsall Creek https://balsallcreek.com/\n  * Compris Vineyard ht
 tps://comprisvineyard.com/\n  * Cristom Vineyards https://cristomvineyard
 s.com/\n  * Del Rio Vineyards https://delriovineyards.com/\n  * Domaine L
 umineux https://domainelumineux.com/\n  * Duck Pond Cellars https://duckp
 ondcellars.com/pages/visit-us#events\n  * Elk Cove Vineyards https://elkc
 ove.com/\n  * Erath Winery https://www.erath.com/\n  * Kristin Hill Winer
 y https://www.kristinhillwinery.com/\n  * Terra Vina Wines https://www.te
 rravinawines.com/\n  * Van Duzer Vineyards https://vanduzervineyards.com/
 \n  * Willamette Valley Vineyards https://www.wvv.com/\n\n\nWhat's Includ
 ed\n\n  * 2 hour sunset cruise on the Willamette River\n  * Views of the 
 Historic Milwaukie Waterfront and downtown Portland\n  * Souvenir stemles
 s wine glass for tasting\n  * Fourteen (14) tasting tickets each good for
  a 1 oz tasting — taste a wine at each winery or skip some wineries and t
 aste various wines from your favorites
CATEGORIES:Wineonwater,boozecruise,foodanddrinks
