SUMMARY: Spring Marketplace
DESCRIPTION:Join us April 25-26 at the Spring Marketplace in Olsrud Arena
 !\n\n✨️🌷 Spring is in the air… and it’s the perfect time to get out\, ge
 t together with friends and explore The Makers Market happening Saturday 
 and Sunday\, April 25th and 26th from 9am-5pm inside the Olsrud Arena at 
 the Jackson County Expo. Enjoy two full days of shopping featuring handma
 de goods\, local favorites\, and one-of-a-kind seasonal finds!\n\nOver 70
  vendors\, including Boutique\, Home Decor\, Jewelry\, Handmade and so mu
 ch more! Face Painting for the Kids\, plus Cloud 9 Cotton Candy will be s
 pinning her favorite flavors! 🍓🍑 Rolling Smoke BBQ Company will be ther
 e\, as well as Bake My Day Cupcake & Cookie Co. and True North Coffee Co.
  Stop by and enjoy a vast array of unique vendors!\n\nCan't wait to see y
 ou there! 🎪\n\nSpring Marketplace at the Expo Fairgrounds\,\n\nApril 25-
 27 from 9am - 6pm.\n\n21 Peninger Rd.\, Central Point\n\nCall 541-821-629
 6 for more information! 📞\n\n
