SUMMARY: Alloro Wine Tasting - Makers Collaboration Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us at our communal Makers Table\, located in the heart o
 f downtown Portland at the Ritz-Carlton\, for a guided wine experience fe
 aturing Alloro Vineyard.\n\nThis curated tasting showcases five wines spa
 nning Alloro’s current vintages\, offering guests the opportunity to expl
 ore the depth\, character\, and craftsmanship of this acclaimed Oregon wi
 nery. Each pour highlights the unique expression of the vineyard\, creati
 ng a journey through terroir and seasonality.\n\nPerfect for wine enthusi
 asts and those looking to discover something new\, this intimate\, commun
 al experience invites conversation\, connection\, and a deeper appreciati
 on for exceptional winemaking.
CATEGORIES:wine,drink,tasting
