SUMMARY: Tallman's Tappin' Talent Series Returns @ Tallman Brewing!
DESCRIPTION:Tallman Brewing announces the Tappin’ Talent Search. This 6-w
 eek electrifying showcase is staging the Pacific Northwest’s most excitin
 g talent and awarding THOUSANDS of dollars in cash & prizes! It’s the Tap
 pin Talent Search brought to you by Breaking Free Media\, KRKT\, 106.3 KL
 OO\, Newsradio 1340\, 1240 Joe Radio\, Tallman Brewing and Axe and Fiddle
 !\n\nSingers. Musicians. Performers of all kinds… this is YOUR moment. St
 ep into the spotlight\, grab the mic\, and show the crowd what you’re mad
 e of. We’re bringing the lights\, the sound\, and the stage — you bring t
 he talent. Come out and support rising artists and unforgettable performa
 nces as the region’s next stars take the stage at the Tappin’ Talent Sear
 ch. Big talent. Big energy. Big prizes. Don’t miss it!\n\nThis year\, Tap
 pin Talent will be held in 2 locations. Lebanon’s Tallman Brewing and Cot
 tage Grove’s Axe & Fiddle.\n\n  * April 15th Spotlight Event @ Tallman Br
 ewing\n  * April 16th Spotlight Event @ Axe & Fiddle\n  * April 22nd Spot
 light Event @ Tallman Brewing\n  * April 23rd Spotlight Event @ Axe & Fid
 dle\n  * April 29th Spotlight Event @ Tallman Brewing\n  * April 30th Spo
 tlight Event @ Axe & Fiddle\n  * May 13th -Semi Finals @ Tallman Brewing\
 n  * May 20th -Final Event@ Tallman Brewing\n\nA full copy of the rules c
 an be obtained at Tallman Brewing - 2055 Primrose St\, Lebanon OR 97355 o
 r Axe & Fiddle 657 E Main Street Cottage Grove OR 97424\, during business
  hours or by sending a self-addressed\, stamped envelope to the above add
 ress.
CATEGORIES:Tappin-Talent,Talent-Show,Brewery,Food-Trucks
