SUMMARY: Good Vibes Highway Tour
DESCRIPTION:About the Good Vibes Highway Tour:\n\nThe Good Vibes Highway 
 Tour is a musical road trip dedicated to sharing positive\, nerdy energy 
 with communities across the U.S. and Canada. Each stop blends humor\, hea
 rt\, and harmony — delivering feel-good acoustic performances that leave 
 audiences smiling and inspired.\n\nWith songs that remind us to “Shine” w
 ith each other and share our positive energy\, the tour celebrates curios
 ity\, kindness\, and connection through music. Fueled by protons\, It’s p
