SUMMARY: Spring Garden Fair 2026
DESCRIPTION:Explore the PNW’s favorite garden event in Canby—it’s worth t
 he drive! We have over 125 local nurseries featuring your favorite plants
 \, alongside local artisans offering unique garden art. Browse local vend
 ors offering specialized gardening supplies\, and tools. Many of our vend
 ors have been at the Fair for over 25 years.\n\nYour favorite Master Gard
 ener activities are returning\, and most of them are free\, like our 10-M
 inute University™ sessions and the Exhibit Hall. Grow your garden with ou
 r Garden Fair Raffle (with prizes in the 100s)\, Silent Auction featuring
  New Plant Introductions\, and a customer favorite - Potting Station with
  free potting soil and information from Master Gardener experts. (They ha
 ve cool new pots to buy too.)\n\nThere is much more to see and do\, inclu
 ding a food court and expert Master Gardener™ advice. Enjoy convenient pe
 rks like free parking\, a food court\, complimentary plant check\, and "P
 lant Taxis" - students tow for tips. Sunday only join us in the Main Pavi
 lion for the Portland Iris Society Early Show and breathtaking Ikebana Di
 splays. And we are bringing back the popular Selfie Spot to commemorate y
 our visit - be sure to stop by!\n\nPlan your visit today and get ready to
  transform your garden this season!
CATEGORIES:plant-sale,Gardening,garden,Master-Gardeners
