SUMMARY: Mark Wayne - May Artist in Residence
DESCRIPTION:Fern & Wolf is a small brick-and-mortar store in Foster-Powel
 l\, specializing in curated home decor and vintage furniture and focusing
  on local artists and makers. With a goal to be a one-of-a-kind art galle
 ry where you can see art in a more lived-in setting\, like you were at ho
 me. Fern & Wolf has a monthly artist residence with an opening night the 
 first Saturday of the month.\n\nJoin on May 2nd from 6-9 and see the work
 s of Mark Wayne\, a Portland transplant\, born and raised in Brooklyn. He
  came up through New York's graffiti scene at a time when the city's wall
 s were the most honest gallery in the world. His visual language draws eq
 ually from hip-hop's golden era and classical design: renissance composit
 ion folded into the album art that defined a generation\, street-level di
 rectness brought intos spaces that typically expect reverence. His styliz
 ed digital art carries all of it forward - rich\, saturated palettes that
  channel NYC grit\, jamaican warmth\, figures rendered with the sharp ele
 gance of African dandyism.\n\nJoin us for good conversation and a (free) 
 glass of wine.
CATEGORIES:art,local,decor,vintage
