SUMMARY: Community Connections Wellness Fair
DESCRIPTION:Explore new ways to support your well-being\n\nFriday\, May 8
  from 9 am - noon\nTouchmark at Fairway Village Lobby\n2911 SE Village Lo
 op\, Vancouver\, WA 98683\n\nJoin us at Touchmark for a lively morning de
 dicated to wellness\, connection\, and discovery. Our Community Connectio
 ns Wellness Fair will bring together a wide variety of local wellness pro
 fessionals\, interactive experiences\, and educational presentations—all 
 designed to help you feel your best.\n\nWith up to 20 exhibitor tables re
 presenting services and resources across the seven dimensions of wellness
 \, this is a wonderful opportunity to explore new ideas\, meet local expe
 rts\, and discover meaningful ways to support your health and lifestyle.\
 n\nThroughout the morning\, enjoy a full schedule of short presentations 
 and demonstrations\, along with pop-in experiences like art therapy and c
 lay therapy.\n\nNo RSVP needed. Call 360-254-2866 for more information.
CATEGORIES:Wellness,Health,Community
