SUMMARY: The Tesla City Stories - Season 10 Premiere! Fri.\, May 8th\, 20
 26 7:30pm
DESCRIPTION:No two shows are ever the same! Tell those April showers to d
 ry up and those May flowers to hang on for a sec: there’s a new show of T
 he Tesla City Stories coming your way!\n\nFirst up is an episode of The W
 raith unperformed for audiences in over 80 years: “After Hours Withdrawal
 .” After battling Hel\, the Norse goddess of the Underworld\, and then a 
 cosmic deity of Chaos called Malsumis\, you could imagine our half-dead a
 venger could use a break. How about a nice\, relaxing bank heist?\n\nThen
  we’re off to the races in a new episode of The Off-Key Life of Viola Har
 per. Due to a goofy accident\, Viola finds herself having to sub-in for t
 he jockey of her Arabian steed Jackie’s Girl! Will she get busted before 
 she makes it the the Winner’s Circle? The race is on in “It’s Viola By A 
 Nose - But Not Furlong!”\n\nIt’s chills and laughs\, plus the music of - 
 Smut City Jellyroll Society - when The Tesla City Stories takes the stage
  at the Old Church Concert Hall this upcoming May the 8th!
CATEGORIES:Theater,Performing-Arts
