DESCRIPTION:Treat your mother to an unforgettable Afternoon Tea in Bellpi
 ne\, where you’ll indulge in a vibrant array of flavors during a 90-minut
 e experience crafted to delight every sense. Savor a curated selection of
  exquisite TEALEAVES loose-leaf teas\, perfectly complemented by artisana
 l tea sandwiches and a delightful assortment of spring-inspired sweets.\n
 \nLocated on the 20th floor of The Ritz-Carlton\, Portland\, with sweepin
 g views of the Rose City and Cascade Range\, this event is made even more
  enchanting by the soulful melodies of live jazz. Throughout your gatheri
 ng\, our Ladies and Gentlemen will offer exceptional\, legendary service 
 to ensure your celebration is nothing short of extraordinary.
