SUMMARY: Make it a Mother’s Day to Remember at Oaks Park on May 10
DESCRIPTION:Oaks Park\, Oregon’s favorite amusement park\, is rolling out
  the red carpet for moms on Mother’s Day this year. On Sunday\, May 10\, 
 moms who purchase a Ride Wristband for their child will receive a free wr
 istband so they\, too\, can ride Oaks Park’s classic thrill rides all day
  long.\n\n“Oaks Park has been a place for family celebrations\, joy and f
 un for generations\,” said Emily MacKay\, Oaks Park’s Marketing and Event
 s Director. “Celebrating moms here on Mother’s Day is the perfect way to 
 carry on that tradition\, enjoy a day of thrills and fun\, and create unf
 orgettable memories for the whole family.”\n\nRide Wristbands at Oaks Par
 k provide access to all 24 rides\, from the Tree Top Drop and the Zoom Co
 aster to the Frog Hopper\, Adrenaline Peak\, AtmosFEAR and so many others
 .\n\nBeyond the thrill rides\, Oaks Park is packed with other ways for mo
 ms to enjoy and celebrate their special day. The park is home to a histor
 ic carousel\, the oldest roller rink in the United States\, scenic picnic
  areas\, carnival games and classic amusement park food and drinks. There
 ’s also the park’s miniature golf course with views of the Willamette Riv
 er and the timeless Oaks Park train.\n\nRide Wristbands are available in 
 two categories based on height: 48” and taller are $44.45 on Mother’s Day
 \, and under 48” are $23.45.\n\nThe Mother’s Day Ride Wristband Special i
 s available Sunday\, May 10\, 2026. Guests may ask for it when they arriv
 e at the Oaks Park ticket booth. The offer is only available onsite\, not
  through the online ticketing platform.\n\nFor more information about Mot
 her’s Day at Oaks Park\, visit Oakspark.com. https://www.oakspark.com/spe
 cials-amusement-park
CATEGORIES:Mothers-Day,Amusement-Park
