SUMMARY: Burlynomicon - May @ The Coffin
DESCRIPTION:When the outside world brings you chaos\, enter into the dark
 ly decadent shadows to revel in glorious art and let your soul recharge…\
 n\nJoin us for an extra special showcase of talent and lore on Tuesday\, 
 MAY 12 in the cozy depths of The Coffin!\n\nWe will gather in the intimat
 e upstairs venue to witness a spectacular showing of the best darkly deca
 dent performance art amongst resplendently eerie surroundings\, where you
  can also peruse the delightful wares of our vendor\, delight in deliciou
 s cocktails\, indulge in food to nourish your weary soul\, and encounter 
 a magical being that will tell you of your fortune.\n\nJoin us in gloriou
 s revelry and witness live and direct...\n\nLADY DREW BLOOD!\n\nGIVEN!\n\
 nLUNA LYNN DAY!\n\n&\n\nBEVIN VICTORIA!\n\n*Be sure to check out our glor
 ious vendors...\nGREEN WITCH!\n&\nBURLYNOMICON merch!\n\nGet a glimpse in
 to your future with OPHELIA DARKLY's Victorian Doll Tarot readings!\n\nPr
 oduced and hosted by Natasha Riot\, Burlynomicon is a darkly decadent mon
 thly showcase of performance (now in its 14th year!) held every second Tu
 esday of the month (January - October) in the incredibly rare\, cryptic e
 xpanse of The Coffin. Venture into the dark speakeasy that features a mon
 thly rotating cast of cabaret and performance art talent from Portland an
 d beyond\, where performers present art & beauty with an eerie and humoro
 us twist.\n\nAdvance tickets are highly recommended\, as capacity is limi
 ted. This show WILL sell out!\n\n- GENERAL ADMISSION SEATING IS TICKETED 
 ONLY. There are standing room only tickets available for pre-sale and at 
 the door (as room allows)\n\n-Doors will open at 7pm. Plan to arrive earl
 y for dinner\, courtesy of the Coffin Cart\, for delicious drink specials
  created just for Burlynomicon\, take time to peruse our delightful vendo
 rs\, and to claim your seat!\n\n- 2 drink minimum of whatever sort of lib
 ation suits your fancy is highly recommended (price not included in ticke
 t).\n\n- Costumes/fancy dress are highly recommended!\n\n- Masks are not 
 required\, yet encouraged\, as we are an intimate venue.\n\n- Please no s
 moking or vaping inside the venue.\n\nThe Coffin Cart (all vegan\, delici
 ously delightful food) will be open to satisfy the pangs in your belly as
  our performers ease the longing in your soul.\n\nBURLYNOMICON - MAY\nTue
 sday\, May 12\nThe Coffin - 421 SE Grand Ave\, Portland\, OR\n\n7pm doors
 \n8pm show\n\n$20 Standing Room Only\n$25 General Admission (seated)\n$35
  Front Row VIP Seating\n\nGeneral Admission ONLINE sales end at 6:45pm Tu
 esday\, May 12\; tickets will be available at the door for a higher price
  after that.\n\nGHOUL - LA - LA!\n\n\n***A quick and important note***\n\
 nBurlynomicon - A Darkly Decadent Burlesque Revue & "Burlynomicon present
 s" events are not affiliated with any other production outside of the Umb
 rae Noctis Festival.
CATEGORIES:
