 hich will be pouring new and limited-release rosé and other varieties of 
 white wines.\n\nThe event welcomes food and wine lovers to explore the aw
 ard-winning wines of the Tualatin Valley in a fun and casual environment 
 while enjoying music from the guest DJ.\n\nThis is a 21+ event. Tickets g
 o on sale April 1\, with limited early-bird pricing available while suppl
 ies last.\n\nGeneral Admission tickets include six tasting tokens. VIP Ad
 mission tickets include 8 tasting tokens and early entry.\n\nAdditional t
 asting tokens and food will be available for purchase. Designated driver 
 tickets are free and include admission to the event only.
