SUMMARY: Tallman's Tappin' Talent Series Returns @ Tallman Brewing!
DESCRIPTION:Tallman Brewing announces the Tappin’ Talent Search. This 6-w
 eek electrifying showcase is staging the Pacific Northwest’s most excitin
 g talent and awarding THOUSANDS of dollars in cash & prizes! It’s the Tap
 pin Talent Search brought to you by Breaking Free Media\, KRKT\, 106.3 KL
