SUMMARY: Serving Tray Painting Workshop at Tallman Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Serving Tray Painting Workshop at Tallman Brewing\n\n\nReady 
 to get creative? Join us for a fun and relaxed evening where you get to p
 aint your own boho style Serving Tray at Tallman Brewing! Whether you're 
 a beginner or a pro\, grab your brushes and enjoy a cool vibe while craft
 ing a unique serving tray you'll be proud to show off. Perfect way to spe
 nd some quality time with friends and let your artistic side shine!\n\n\n
 All Materials are provided. Each Artist gets their choice of paint colors
  and acrylic paint markers to create with on a wood serving tray with han
 dles ( approx. 11 x 14 in size ).\n\n\nIts the Perfect DIY project to bri
 ghten up your Patio Table while serving your beverages or use it as a tra
 y for candles\, mail or a cute arrangement for plants.\n\n\nHow you creat
 e it is completely up to you and your personal Vibe.\n\n\nMrs. Claudia wi
 ll guide you through the process with tips\, tricks & ideas\, Plus a shee
 t with inspiration of color combinations and designs.\n\n\nBring your Fri
 ends\, Sister\, Mother or daughter to create something unique and have a 
 tasty beverage and/or food from tallman's many Food Trucks! (food and bev
 erage are not included in The Ticket Price ).\n\n\nWe highly recommend to
  arrive early if you decide to have dinner as table space can get a bit t
 ight during the class.\n\n\nWe're so excited to bring you something new a
 nd unique - lets have a great time!
CATEGORIES:Painting,Workshop,Brewery,Food-Trucks
