SUMMARY: Forward Into Light – Music for Women’s Voices
DESCRIPTION:Iris Levine leads a 70 voice women’s chorus in a timely and i
 nspiring concert featuring Andrea Ramsey’s multi-media Suffrage Cantata f
 or chorus\, chamber orchestra and narrator. It is an urgent exploration o
 f America’s women’s suffrage movement\, told from the personal histories 
 of diverse women. Singer and actor Simone Ledward Boseman is guest narrat
 or.\n\nThe composer writes\, “Some of the most revered figures in the U.S
 . Women's Suffrage Movement have been romanticized in ways that omit mass
 ive flaws of judgment… I have tried to craft a work that is honest about 
 the heroism of these figures while also acknowledging their flaws.” The d
 ynamic program is rounded out with choral music by Pablo Casals\, Emily D
 rum\, Rosephanye Powell and more.
CATEGORIES:
