SUMMARY: Wild Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Experience the zoo after hours\, without daytime crowds or ki
 ds.\n\nLooking to spice up your midweek with a fun night out? Beat the hu
 mp day blues and check out Wild Wednesdays this summer at the Oregon Zoo!
  This 21+ only series offers two adult-only summer evenings at the zoo fo
 r a special discounted price. Kick back with themed cocktails and mocktai
 ls and delicious food available for purchase. Wild Wednesdays will occur 
 on July 1 and Aug. 5.\n\nEnjoy live entertainment\, keeper chats\, animal
  encounters and a chance to get to know some of the animals active during
  twilight hours. Plus\, ride the zoo train and carousel for free all nigh
 t long. Gather friends\, bring a date or come solo and enjoy a lively sum
 mer night at the zoo!\n\n\nEach Wild Wednesday has a special theme:\n\n  
 * Island Time\, July 1: Party at the zoo with tropical style! Come dresse
 d in your favorite island attire—think floral prints\, fun hats and sungl
 asses—to pair with a tasty cocktail or mocktail.\n  * Retro Rewind\, Aug.
  5: It’s a blast from the past! Celebrate your favorite decade with your 
 best retro attire. Every era is in play—the roaring ‘20s\, swinging ‘60s\
 , radical ‘80s\, grungy ‘90s\, Y2K and more.
CATEGORIES:Zoo,nightlife,21+
